# Local dev context for an AI assistant: kept on disk, never in the public repo.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/

# ...but the enclave TEMPLATE is shipped on purpose. It only survives the
# rule above because git will not untrack retroactively; say so explicitly so a
# remove-and-re-add cannot silently drop it from the package.
!share/enclave/CLAUDE.md
